    "answer": {
      "short": "$\\angle CBD=y$, so $\\angle BCD=180^\\circ-2y$ and $\\angle BCA=2y$. Since $CA=BA$, $\\angle ABC=2y$. Thus $x+2y+2y=180^\\circ$, giving $x+4y=180^\\circ$.",
      "worked": {
